rren-wilson.edu Mitchell A 204 Visit Profile Bob Strain, DMA Adjunct Music Faculty bob-strain@warren-wilson.edu Visit Profile Robert Swoap, Ph.D. Professor of Psychology bswoap@warren-wilson.edu Boon 220 Visit Profile Charlotte Taylor, MFA Assistant Professor of Media Arts and Photography |                       Chair, Art and Craft charlotte-taylor@warren-wilson.edu Holden Visit Profile Kaela E. Thuney, Ph.D. Assistant Professor of History kthuney@warren-wilson.edu Visit Profile Michelle Tuday Adjunct Instructor of Outdoor Leadership |                       Assistant Director of Adventure Programs mtuday@warren-wilson.edu 828-771-3754 Bryson Gym Visit Profile Tony VanWinkle, Ph.D. Assistant Professor of Sustainable Agriculture & Food Studies tony-vanwinkle@warren-wilson.edu 828-771-3904 Morse 101 Visit Profile Gretchen W. Whipple, Ph.D. Emeritus Professor of Mathematics gwhipple@warren-wilson.edu Visit Profile Melanie Wilder Instructor of Art and Craft - Fiber Arts mwilder@warren-wilson.edu (828) 230-3819 Fortune 817 Visit Profile Yuemei Zhang, Ph.D. Associate Professor of Chemistry yuemei.zhang@warren-wilson.edu (828) 771-3786 Witherspoon 204 Visit Profile Follow Us Facebook Instagram TikTok YouTube Quick Links Employment Contact Us Campus Map Campus Events Emergency Resources Title IX Accessibility Media Relations Apply now Request Info Give Visit © Copyright  Warren Wilson College Privacy Policy"
